    \item \textbf{Temporal Lobe:} auditory processing, memory encoding.
    \item \textbf{Occipital Lobe:} visual processing, feature extraction.
\end{itemize}

Each lobe is represented by a functional manifold $\mathcal{M}_\ell$ with
localized processing tensors:
\[
\bm{T}_\ell = \nabla_{\mathcal{M}_\ell} \bm{x}(t).
\]

